Mode (unlocked after story completion) to create the Frankensteinian rocket of your dreams!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422430/extras/ef22340998f194ef2ac49b4687a29682.poster.avif?t=1637781966\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422430/extras/ef22340998f194ef2ac49b4687a29682.webm?t=1637781966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422430/extras/ef22340998f194ef2ac49b4687a29682.mp4?t=1637781966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
